ment before production or order confirmation.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Remaining 50% upon delivery or shipment confirmation.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Payments can be made via bank transfer, or credit card.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span><br><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Other information:&nbsp;</span></h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Shelf Life:</strong> 24 months (store in a cool, dry place).</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Certifications:</strong> Non-GMO, vegan-friendly.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Shipping:</strong> Worldwide shipping available with tracking.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>MOQ (Minimum Order Quantity):</strong> 500 boxes for wholesale orders.</span></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Customer Support:</strong> Dedicated support team to assist with orders, inquiries, and product information.</span></li>\r\n</ul>",
